{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Surreal Puzzle Shooter Adventure Fueled By Madness! ART IS RIFLE is an open-world, FPS puzzle game with rhythmic bullets and psychedelic art styles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PSYCHEDELIC REINVENTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a psychedelic adventure through first-of-its-kind mind altering core gameplay mechanics, beyond visual and auditory designs!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/a9a7871dec4f564dec885d4452e217a8.poster.avif?t=1770388153\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/a9a7871dec4f564dec885d4452e217a8.webm?t=1770388153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/a9a7871dec4f564dec885d4452e217a8.mp4?t=1770388153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VISUALS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a visually striking game that dances with a fusion of intense colors and mind-altering, psychedelic elements.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/301063838a3b7a2d4c132d31c3273812.poster.avif?t=1770388153\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/301063838a3b7a2d4c132d31c3273812.webm?t=1770388153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/301063838a3b7a2d4c132d31c3273812.mp4?t=1770388153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A work of art is a puzzle; when solved, it exposes the hidden layers of meaning and symbolism.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MUSIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whole world is your drum kit!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world of structures as puzzles, where tutorials are optional and discovery is key! The game rewards observant players and humbles the unobservant with frustration\u2014a clever form of punishment that spurs discovery, rather than closing off all alternative solutions. There are multiple ways to solve each structure\u2014it's up to you which way you choose.\u00a0After all... Puzzles are your canvas in this game!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/02fcf4be51182625e6acf2df45b2c5ef.poster.avif?t=1770388153\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/02fcf4be51182625e6acf2df45b2c5ef.webm?t=1770388153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2486730/extras/02fcf4be51182625e6acf2df45b2c5ef.mp4?t=1770388153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"That Was Easy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486730/4a295d149f3ecaa589e762da7881b2b417b73bd8.jpg"},{"name":"Was that A Boss Fight?!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486730/a29b58b01af6fb1536945752b8884ebd28fd03b9.jpg"},{"name":"That Was Not Easy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486730/7d7cff99a43b0c98d523a6446187741940f1af9c.jpg"},{"name":"I Hate These Gates","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2486730/10adb6034ad0f481ff8b5a763e8561b3c2ec4ce7.jpg"},{"name":"Credit to the Wall!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity